==Trivia==
* Originally, the Masori armour would have made use of the [[Low Life]] status effect, in which players wearing the armour set with less than 40% of their health would have had their Ranged Attack and [[Ranged Strength]] bonus increased. The [[Masori amulet]], which was later scrapped, would assist players in achieving the Low Life effect by damaging players until the status took effect. In addition, the full armour set had an 8% chance to [[dodge]] an incoming attack, negating damage from any non-[[typeless]] attack.
** The aforementioned effects were later removed in favour of fortifying the armour set after player feedback that the armour's set effects were not worth the tradeoff for being at low health.

